# Indielayer UI

- Primary package: `packages/ui` (`@indielayer/ui`)
- Node.js 24 and pnpm 11 (see root `package.json` `packageManager`)
- Use `pnpm` (not npm/yarn) from repo root
- Before finishing UI changes: run `pnpm lint:ui` and `pnpm test` when you touched `packages/ui`
- Do not edit `lib/` or other build output
- Commits follow `.github/COMMIT_CONVENTION.md` (e.g. `feat(divider): adjust spacing`)
- Publishing changes need a changeset: `pnpm changeset`
- See `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/` for workflows
